{
  "lessonId": "L2M1L3",
  "title": "Liguria 利古里亞 - 海岸葡萄酒",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3498db 0%,#2ecc71 100%)'><h1>🌊 Liguria 利古里亞</h1><p class='subtitle'>地中海陽光下的陡峭葡萄園</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>🗺️ Liguria 產區地圖</h2><div class='map-slide-container'><div id='liguria-map' class='liguria-region-map'></div><div class='map-legend' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(26,26,46,0.95),rgba(26,26,46,0.98));backdrop-filter:blur(15px);border-radius:16px;padding:30px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)'><h3 style='margin:0 0 25px;color:#fff;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;text-align:center;border-bottom:3px solid rgba(52,152,219,0.8);padding-bottom:12px'>圖例說明</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15)'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600'>🌍 大區邊界</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 0'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:rgba(52,152,219,0.15);border:3px solid #3498db;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>Liguria 大區範圍（地中海海岸）</span></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15)'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600'>🍷 產區分級（DOC 邊界）</h4><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#f39c12;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(243,156,18,0.6)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>S級 - Cinque Terre DOC 世界遺產</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#e74c3c;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(231,76,60,0.5)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>A級 - Colli di Luni DOC Vermentino 精品</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#e67e22;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(230,126,34,0.5)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>A級 - Rossese di Dolceacqua 紅酒之王</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#3498db;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(52,152,219,0.5)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>B級 - Colline di Levanto DOC</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#5dade2;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(93,173,226,0.5)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>B級 - Val Polcèvera DOC</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#3498db;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(52,152,219,0.6)'></div><span style='color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:500'>重要城市</span></div></div></div><div style='background:rgba(102,126,234,0.15);border-radius:10px;padding:18px;margin-top:5px;border:1px solid rgba(102,126,234,0.3)'><p style='margin:0 0 10px;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem'>💡 地圖操作提示：</p><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);line-height:1.8;list-style:none'><li style='padding-left:0;margin:5px 0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500'>🖱️ 滑鼠滾輪縮放地圖</li><li style='padding-left:0;margin:5px 0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500'>🖐️ 拖曳移動視角</li><li style='padding-left:0;margin:5px 0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500'>📍 點擊區域查看產區詳情</li></ul></div></div></div><style>.map-slide-container{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:30px;height:calc(100vh - 200px);min-height:500px;padding:20px}.liguria-region-map{width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.3);background:#1a1a2e}.map-legend{background:rgba(26,26,46,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-radius:12px;padding:25px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);height:fit-content;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}</style></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏖️ 義大利的「里維耶拉」</h2><div class='intro-section'><div class='intro-text'><p>Liguria 是義大利西北部的新月形海岸產區，以<strong>Cinque Terre</strong>（五漁村）的陡峭梯田葡萄園聞名。產量小但獨特性高。</p></div><div class='region-stats'><div class='stat-box'><span class='stat-icon'>🏖️</span><div class='stat-content'><span class='stat-num'>300 km</span><span class='stat-label'>海岸線長度</span></div></div><div class='stat-box'><span class='stat-icon'>⛰️</span><div class='stat-content'><span class='stat-num'>45°+</span><span class='stat-label'>葡萄園坡度</span></div></div><div class='stat-box'><span class='stat-icon'>🍷</span><div class='stat-content'><span class='stat-num'>8</span><span class='stat-label'>DOC 產區</span></div></div></div><div class='challenge-note'><h4>🏔️ 英雄般的葡萄種植</h4><p>Liguria 的葡萄園大多建在<strong>陡峭的海岸懸崖</strong>上，需要手工採收，勞動強度極高，因此產量少、價格高。</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 三大白葡萄品種</h2><div class='grape-profiles'><div class='grape-item main'><div class='grape-badge'>代表品種</div><h3>Vermentino</h3><div class='grape-details'><p><strong>別名：</strong>Pigato（Liguria 西部）、Favorita（Piemonte）</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>檸檬、葡萄柚、白花、<strong>海風鹹味</strong>、杏仁</p><p><strong>結構：</strong>中高酸度、中等酒體、清新</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>明顯的<strong>海洋礦物感</strong>和鹹鮮味</p><p><strong>代表酒款：</strong>Colli di Luni Vermentino DOC</p></div></div><div class='grape-item'><div class='grape-badge'>五漁村專用</div><h3>Bosco</h3><div class='grape-details'><p><strong>用途：</strong>Cinque Terre DOC 的主要品種（60% 以上）</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>白花、柑橘、礦物、海鹽</p><p><strong>結構：</strong>高酸度、清爽、輕到中等酒體</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>適應陡坡環境，海洋風味濃郁</p></div></div><div class='grape-item'><div class='grape-badge'>稀有甜酒</div><h3>Albarola</h3><div class='grape-details'><p><strong>用途：</strong>Cinque Terre Sciacchetrà（甜酒）的混釀品種</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>杏桃、蜂蜜、柑橘皮、香料</p><p><strong>特色：</strong>風乾葡萄釀造，極珍貴</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏞️ Cinque Terre 五漁村</h2><div class='cinque-terre-section'><div class='ct-intro'><h3>🌈 世界遺產葡萄園</h3><p>Cinque Terre（五漁村）是 UNESCO 世界遺產，五個彩色小漁村點綴在陡峭海岸上，葡萄園建在<strong>45 度以上</strong>的梯田上。</p></div><div class='ct-wines'><div class='wine-card white'><h4>⚪ Cinque Terre DOC</h4><p><strong>品種：</strong>Bosco 60%+, Albarola, Vermentino</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>清新、鹹鮮、礦物、海風</p><p><strong>酒精度：</strong>11-12%</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>海鮮、義式海鮮湯、炸鯷魚</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>典型的<strong>海岸白酒</strong></p></div><div class='wine-card sweet'><h4>🍯 Cinque Terre Sciacchetrà DOC</h4><p><strong>類型：</strong>甜白酒（風乾葡萄）</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Bosco, Albarola, Vermentino</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>蜂蜜、杏桃乾、柑橘皮、堅果</p><p><strong>酒精度：</strong>17-22%</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>Cantucci 餅乾、藍紋起司、杏桃塔</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>極稀有，手工風乾數月</p></div></div><div class='ct-fact'><p>💡 <strong>Sciacchetrà</strong> 名稱來自方言「schiaccià e tirà」（壓榨和拉扯），形容釀造過程的艱辛。</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌊 海洋風土的影響</h2><div class='maritime-influence'><div class='influence-card'><div class='influence-icon'>🌊</div><h4>海風調節</h4><p>地中海的<strong>海風</strong>帶來涼爽空氣，降低溫度，保持葡萄的<strong>酸度</strong>和<strong>清新感</strong>。</p></div><div class='influence-card'><div class='influence-icon'>🧂</div><h4>鹹鮮礦物</h4><p>海風中的<strong>鹽分</strong>和海洋礦物質沉積在葡萄園，賦予酒款獨特的<strong>鹹鮮味</strong>。</p></div><div class='influence-card'><div class='influence-icon'>☀️</div><h4>充足日照</h4><p>陡峭南向坡面接受<strong>充分日照</strong>，葡萄成熟度佳，風味濃郁。</p></div><div class='influence-card'><div class='influence-icon'>🌡️</div><h4>溫和氣候</h4><p>地中海氣候<strong>冬暖夏涼</strong>，生長季長，葡萄緩慢成熟。</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📍 其他重要產區</h2><div class='other-docs'><div class='doc-card'><h4>Colli di Luni DOC</h4><p class='doc-location'>東部（與 Tuscany 交界）</p><div class='doc-info'><p><strong>品種：</strong>Vermentino（白）、Sangiovese（紅）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>Vermentino 版本優質，礦物感強</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>受 Tuscany 影響，風格較濃郁</p></div></div><div class='doc-card'><h4>Riviera Ligure di Ponente DOC</h4><p class='doc-location'>西部海岸</p><div class='doc-info'><p><strong>品種：</strong>Vermentino（Pigato）、Rossese</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>清新海岸風格</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>產量較大、價格親民</p></div></div><div class='doc-card'><h4>Rossese di Dolceacqua DOC</h4><p class='doc-location'>西部（近法國邊境）</p><div class='doc-info'><p><strong>品種：</strong>Rossese（紅葡萄）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>輕盈紅酒、草莓、玫瑰、草本</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>Liguria 少數紅酒產區</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍴 Liguria 飲食文化</h2><div class='food-culture'><div class='culture-intro'><h3>🌿 青醬的故鄉</h3><p><strong>Pesto alla Genovese</strong>（熱那亞青醬）發源於 Liguria，是世界最著名的義大利醬料之一。</p></div><div class='food-pairing'><div class='pairing-item'><h4>🌿 Pesto 青醬麵</h4><p><strong>配酒：</strong>Vermentino（草本香氣呼應）</p></div><div class='pairing-item'><h4>🐟 Liguria 海鮮湯</h4><p><strong>配酒：</strong>Cinque Terre DOC（鹹鮮礦物感匹配）</p></div><div class='pairing-item'><h4>🥖 Focaccia 麵包</h4><p><strong>配酒：</strong>Pigato（橄欖油風味搭配）</p></div><div class='pairing-item'><h4>🐟 炸鯷魚</h4><p><strong>配酒：</strong>Vermentino（高酸度切割油膩）</p></div><div class='pairing-item'><h4>🍰 Sciacchetrà 甜酒</h4><p><strong>配餐：</strong>Cantucci 杏仁餅、Pandolce 甜麵包</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Liguria 以陡峭海岸梯田葡萄園聞名</div><div class='point'>✓ Vermentino 展現獨特的海洋礦物感和鹹鮮味</div><div class='point'>✓ Cinque Terre 是 UNESCO 世界遺產葡萄園</div><div class='point'>✓ Sciacchetrà 是極稀有的風乾甜白酒</div><div class='point'>✓ 海風賦予 Liguria 葡萄酒清新和鹹鮮特色</div><div class='point'>✓ 產量少、手工採收，價格較高</div></div></section></div><style>.intro-section{display:grid;gap:20px}.intro-text p{font-size:1.1rem;l